{"seq":2,"slug":"crafting-graph","title":"合成依赖图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-crafting-systems/recipes/crafting-graph","wordCount":1466,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"合成依赖图\">合成依赖图</h1><p>要造一把钢剑,你需要钢锭;要造钢锭,你需要铁锭和煤;要造铁锭,你需要铁矿。这条链条一层层往下,就构成了一张图。当一个游戏有几百条配方时,这张图会变得极其庞大,而它的形状——有多深、有没有环、瓶颈在哪——直接决定了玩家的合成体验和你能不能准确算出「造一把钢剑真正要挖多少矿」。这一篇是全 hub 唯一深入讲合成依赖图结构与算法的地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-配方构成有向无环图\">核心概念：配方构成有向无环图</h2><p>把每个物品看成一个节点,每条「配方的输入指向输出」看成一条有向边,整个合成系统就是一张<strong>有向无环图(DAG)</strong>。铁矿→铁锭→钢锭→钢剑是一条路径,叶节点是原料(没有入边的加工需求),顶节点是最终产物。</p>\n<p>它必须是「无环」的:如果 A 需要 B、B 又需要 A,玩家永远造不出任何一个,系统死锁。因此配方数据在加载时必须做环检测——这是<a href=\"../foundations/crafting-model\">配方数据模型</a>提到的启动期校验里最关键的一项。环检测用标准的图算法:对整张图做深度优先搜索,若在一次遍历中回到了当前递归栈上的节点,即存在环。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[铁矿 raw] --&gt; B[铁锭 refined]&#10;  C[煤 raw] --&gt; D[钢锭 refined]&#10;  B --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[剑刃 component]&#10;  F[木材 raw] --&gt; G[剑柄 component]&#10;  E --&gt; H[钢剑 产物]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  I[皮革 refined] --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[铁矿 raw] --&gt; B[铁锭 refined]\n  C[煤 raw] --&gt; D[钢锭 refined]\n  B --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[剑刃 component]\n  F[木材 raw] --&gt; G[剑柄 component]\n  E --&gt; H[钢剑 产物]\n  G --&gt; H\n  I[皮革 refined] --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"展开成本-造一把剑要挖多少矿\">展开成本:造一把剑要挖多少矿</h2><p>依赖图最实用的价值,是能递归地算出一个高级产物的<strong>完整原料成本</strong>——把所有中间产物一路展开到叶节点。这对经济平衡至关重要:你必须知道一把钢剑的真实底层成本,才能给它定合理的售价和产出。</p>\n<p>设产物 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的配方把它分解为若干输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{(y_i, c_i)\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span></span></span></span></span>,其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是数量,则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的原料成本向量可递归定义:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>raw</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mtext>raw</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cost}(x) = \\sum_{i} c_i \\cdot \\text{cost}(y_i), \\qquad \\text{cost}(\\text{raw}) = e_{\\text{raw}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">raw</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">raw</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中原料的 cost 是它自身的单位基向量(即「1 个铁矿」)。递归到叶节点终止。对一张 DAG,可以用拓扑排序后自底向上一遍算出所有节点的展开成本,复杂度线性于边数。</p>\n<p>举个具体的例子,下表展示一把钢剑的逐层展开:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>产物</th>\n<th>直接配方</th>\n<th>展开到原料</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>钢剑</td>\n<td>剑刃×1 + 剑柄×1 + 皮革×1</td>\n<td>——</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>剑刃</td>\n<td>钢锭×2</td>\n<td>铁矿×2 + 煤×2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钢锭</td>\n<td>铁锭×1 + 煤×1</td>\n<td>铁矿×1 + 煤×1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>剑柄</td>\n<td>木材×2</td>\n<td>木材×2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>皮革</td>\n<td>兽皮×2</td>\n<td>兽皮×2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>合计</strong></td>\n<td>——</td>\n<td><strong>铁矿×2, 煤×2, 木材×2, 兽皮×2</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个「合计」就是造一把钢剑的真实底层成本,是经济调校的输入。成本如何进一步换算成经济价值,见<a href=\"../practice/crafting-economy\">合成与经济平衡</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"图的深度-平衡感与繁琐感\">图的深度:平衡感与繁琐感</h2><p>依赖图的<strong>深度</strong>(从原料到最终产物的最长路径)是一个关键的体验旋钮。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>太浅</strong>(1–2 层):合成沦为「材料→产物」的简单兑换,缺乏加工的层次感和成长空间。</li>\n<li><strong>太深</strong>(6+ 层):玩家要造一件东西得先造五个中间产物,每步都要跑工作台、凑材料,繁琐到令人放弃。《7 Days to Die》式的深合成树就常被诟病劝退。</li>\n<li><strong>适中</strong>(3–4 层):既有加工的递进感,又不至于让人淹没在中间产物里。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>深度还与解锁节奏耦合:图的每一层往往对应一个解锁阶段,玩家先解锁精炼,再解锁组件,最后解锁高级产物。这种「沿图分层解锁」是进度设计的骨架,详见<a href=\"../progression/crafting-unlocks\">解锁与技能树</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"瓶颈材料与图分析\">瓶颈材料与图分析</h2><p>一张成熟的合成图里,某些原料会成为<strong>瓶颈</strong>——大量高级配方都最终依赖它。在图上,瓶颈就是「被最多路径经过」的叶节点。识别瓶颈很重要:如果一个稀有原料被几乎所有高级配方依赖,它的采集难度就成了整个后期进度的总闸门,调它的产量会牵一发而动全身。</p>\n<p>反过来,如果某个中间产物没有任何配方使用它,它就是<strong>死节点</strong>——设计错误或内容遗留,应当在图分析时被工具自动标出。这类静态图分析是配方调校的重要一环,见<a href=\"../practice/crafting-tuning\">配方调校</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[稀有水晶 瓶颈原料] --&gt; B[魔力核心]&#10;  A --&gt; C[附魔尘]&#10;  B --&gt; D[法杖]&#10;  B --&gt; E[护符]&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  C --&gt; F[附魔卷轴]&#10;  G[普通铁矿] --&gt; H[未被任何配方使用&lt;br/&gt;死节点-设计错误]\">flowchart TD\n  A[稀有水晶 瓶颈原料] --&gt; B[魔力核心]\n  A --&gt; C[附魔尘]\n  B --&gt; D[法杖]\n  B --&gt; E[护符]\n  C --&gt; D\n  C --&gt; F[附魔卷轴]\n  G[普通铁矿] --&gt; H[未被任何配方使用&lt;br/&gt;死节点-设计错误]</pre><h2 id=\"依赖图与建造-科技树的相通\">依赖图与建造/科技树的相通</h2><p>合成依赖图的结构不是合成独有的。放置类建造的部件连接、科技树的前置关系、任务链的先后依赖,本质都是 DAG 上的可达性与展开问题。建造系统里「结构如何由部件连接而成」的连通图分析,可对照<a href=\"../../game-building-construction-systems/structure/connectivity-graph\">建造系统的连通图</a>;而配方之间的解锁前置,又和数据驱动的依赖管理相通。把合成图和这些系统统一用图来建模,能复用同一套算法和可视化工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>配方系统天然是一张 DAG:物品为节点,「输入→输出」为边;必须做环检测防死锁。</li>\n<li>递归展开可算出高级产物的真实原料成本,是经济平衡的关键输入;拓扑排序自底向上一遍算完。</li>\n<li>图深度是体验旋钮:太浅无层次、太深太繁琐,3–4 层通常适中;深度常与解锁阶段耦合。</li>\n<li>图分析能识别瓶颈原料(后期总闸门)和死节点(设计错误),是调校的一环。</li>\n<li>合成图与建造连通图、科技树本质同源,可复用图算法与工具。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub:<a href=\"../foundations/crafting-model\">配方数据模型</a>——依赖图从 inputs 字段构建,环检测属其校验。</li>\n<li>同 hub:<a href=\"../practice/crafting-economy\">合成与经济平衡</a>——展开成本如何换算成经济价值。</li>\n<li>跨 hub:<a href=\"../../game-building-construction-systems/structure/connectivity-graph\">建造系统 · 连通图</a>——同源的图结构分析。</li>\n<li>跨 hub:<a href=\"../../game-quest-objective-systems/\">任务与目标系统</a>——任务链同样是 DAG 依赖。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"合成依赖图","id":"合成依赖图"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：配方构成有向无环图","id":"核心概念-配方构成有向无环图"},{"level":2,"text":"展开成本:造一把剑要挖多少矿","id":"展开成本-造一把剑要挖多少矿"},{"level":2,"text":"图的深度:平衡感与繁琐感","id":"图的深度-平衡感与繁琐感"},{"level":2,"text":"瓶颈材料与图分析","id":"瓶颈材料与图分析"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖图与建造/科技树的相通","id":"依赖图与建造-科技树的相通"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"材料与品质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-crafting-systems/recipes/ingredients-materials"},"next":{"title":"产出与随机品质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-crafting-systems/recipes/output-quality"}}